{"page":429,"width":1723,"height":2555,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"Part 5","words":[{"text":"Part","x":550,"y":492,"width":130,"height":50},{"text":"5","x":704,"y":495,"width":34,"height":47}]},{"text":"~尹孑宓孑캬","words":[{"text":"~尹孑宓孑캬","x":132,"y":600,"width":625,"height":133}]},{"text":"5/夕\"矛로″″矛3″″","words":[{"text":"5/夕\"矛로″″矛3″″","x":148,"y":744,"width":725,"height":105}]},{"text":"컴퓨터 시스템은 파일과 데이터를 영구적으로 저장하기 위한 대용량 저장장치를 제공해야 한","words":[{"text":"컴퓨터","x":267,"y":956,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"시스템은","x":378,"y":957,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"파일과","x":521,"y":960,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"데이터를","x":628,"y":960,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"영구적으로","x":758,"y":961,"width":144,"height":33},{"text":"저장하기","x":914,"y":960,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"위한","x":1040,"y":961,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"대용량","x":1110,"y":960,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"저장장치를","x":1205,"y":960,"width":144,"height":34},{"text":"제공해야","x":1362,"y":958,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1496,"y":958,"width":30,"height":32}]},{"text":"다. 최신 컴퓨터는 보조저장장치로서 하드 디스크와 비휘발성 메모리 장치를 모두 사용하여 대","words":[{"text":"다.","x":268,"y":1010,"width":39,"height":33},{"text":"최신","x":323,"y":1011,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"컴퓨터는","x":401,"y":1013,"width":126,"height":33},{"text":"보조저장장치로서","x":538,"y":1015,"width":238,"height":33},{"text":"하드","x":789,"y":1016,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"디스크와","x":859,"y":1015,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"비휘발성","x":983,"y":1015,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"메모리","x":1106,"y":1016,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"장치를","x":1200,"y":1016,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"모두","x":1296,"y":1016,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"사용하여","x":1364,"y":1013,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"대","x":1498,"y":1013,"width":27,"height":32}]},{"text":"용량 저장장치를 구현한다.","words":[{"text":"용량","x":266,"y":1064,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"저장장치를","x":345,"y":1066,"width":161,"height":33},{"text":"구현한다.","x":516,"y":1069,"width":129,"height":34}]},{"text":"보조저장장치는 여러 측면에서 다양하다. 일부는 한 번에 하나의 문자를 전송하고 일부는","words":[{"text":"보조저장장치는","x":332,"y":1121,"width":225,"height":34},{"text":"여러","x":571,"y":1124,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"측면에서","x":642,"y":1124,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"다양하다.","x":774,"y":1123,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"일부는","x":910,"y":1123,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"한","x":1006,"y":1124,"width":30,"height":31},{"text":"번에","x":1047,"y":1124,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"하나의","x":1113,"y":1124,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"문자를","x":1209,"y":1125,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"전송하고","x":1307,"y":1122,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"일부는","x":1438,"y":1121,"width":90,"height":32}]},{"text":"문자 블록을 전송한다. 일부는 순차적O구만 액세스 하고 다른 일부는 무작위로 액세스 할 수","words":[{"text":"문자","x":267,"y":1174,"width":67,"height":31},{"text":"블록을","x":346,"y":1175,"width":97,"height":31},{"text":"전송한다.","x":458,"y":1176,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"일부는","x":607,"y":1179,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"순차적O구만","x":708,"y":1178,"width":175,"height":32},{"text":"액세스","x":895,"y":1177,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"하고","x":992,"y":1178,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"다른","x":1062,"y":1178,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"일부는","x":1129,"y":1179,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"무작위로","x":1224,"y":1179,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"액세스","x":1352,"y":1176,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"할","x":1455,"y":1176,"width":31,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":1496,"y":1176,"width":32,"height":32}]},{"text":"있다. 일부는 동기식으로 데이터를 전송하고 다른 일부는 비동기식으로 데이터를 전송한다. 일","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":269,"y":1227,"width":70,"height":32},{"text":"일부는","x":357,"y":1228,"width":96,"height":32},{"text":"동기식으로","x":464,"y":1230,"width":157,"height":33},{"text":"데이터를","x":634,"y":1232,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"전송하고","x":762,"y":1232,"width":115,"height":32},{"text":"다른","x":889,"y":1232,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"일부는","x":956,"y":1232,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"비동기식으로","x":1053,"y":1232,"wi